# MUTATION: a sibling fgb:Topic (same declared class as pplan-actuation) with ordering but NO fgb:dedupAttribute.
# Union with ontology/fnox-gcp-broker.ttl (a union court cannot delete the attribute from
# fgb:topic_pplan_actuation itself, so the falsifier is an additive sibling lacking the attribute).
# Expected: gates/010_topic_dedup.rq returns >= 1 row for fgb:topic_mutant_no_dedup (missing-dedup-attribute);
#   shapes/fgb.shacl.ttl does not conform.
@prefix gtf: <https://seanchatmangpt.dev/ontology/gcp-terraform#> .
@prefix fgb: <https://seanchatmangpt.dev/ontology/fnox-gcp-broker#> .

fgb:topic_mutant_no_dedup a fgb:Topic ; gtf:inModule gtf:mod_broker ; gtf:order 12 ;
    gtf:resourceType "google_pubsub_topic" ; gtf:resourceName "mutant_no_dedup" ;
    fgb:gcpName "pplan-actuation-mutant" ;
    fgb:messageOrdering true .
